This directory contains information we usually distribute as marketing brochures
printed on paper. These materials include:

    HIGHLITE - short paragraphs with highlights
    GENERAL  - general description
    SHORT    - short list of main features
    USERS    - quotes from happy users
    AUTHOR   - about the author of the library
    COMPARE  - comparing Code Farms and Rogue Wave libraries
    META     - press release on access to meta-class information

These are all  plain  ASCII  files,   not  as neatly formatted as our marketing
brochures.  However,  consider how much more information you get by having this
diskette instead of reading a few sheets of paper that would come in the mail.
